      "title": "Apple says more ex-employees may have taken confidential data to OpenAI",
      "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/04/apple-says-more-ex-employees-may-have-taken-confidential-data-to-openai/",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49170479",
      "score": 338,
      "comments": 252,
      "author": "thewebguyd",
      "published": "2026-08-04T15:37:42Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Escalating IP disputes between Apple and OpenAI highlight severe insider threat risks driven by fierce competition for frontier AI talent.",
        "Proprietary training datasets and model architectures represent core corporate IP, making rigorous endpoint DLP critical during employee offboarding.",
        "AI labs face growing legal and operational scrutiny over trade secret contamination when onboarding key researchers from rival tech firms."
      ]
    },
