      "bullets": [
        "Defender asymmetry requires securing complex API, IAM, and supply chain dependencies, whereas attackers require only a single misconfiguration or unpatched vulnerability.",
        "Relying on single-layer defenses fails; robust security demands defense-in-depth, strict least-privilege access, automated dependency scanning, and proactive patch management.",
        "Security controls must integrate seamlessly into CI/CD pipelines to maintain developer velocity without introducing bypasses or unmanaged shadow infrastructure."
